    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "and got a few cells from the tumor I was",
    "startSeconds": 672.2,
    "durationSeconds": 5.96,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "sedated but my wife who was there told",
    "startSeconds": 675.079,
