    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "form of pancreatic cancer that is",
    "startSeconds": 684.519,
    "durationSeconds": 5.201,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "curable with surgery I had the surgery",
    "startSeconds": 686.519,
    "durationSeconds": 6.76,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "and thankfully I'm fine",
    "startSeconds": 689.72,
    "durationSeconds": 3.559,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "now this was the closest I've been to",
    "startSeconds": 699.16,
    "durationSeconds": 4.799,
    "lang": "en"
  },
  {
    "text": "facing death and I hope it's the closest",
